# Wrapper colors. build.bat reads this file and bakes it into the app.
#
# Every value is a hex color: #rgb or #rrggbb.
#
# bg            window and page background.
# surface       buttons, panels, dialogs.
# surfaceHover  surface on hover.
# line          borders, rules, switch track when off.
# text          primary text.
# muted         secondary text and links.
# mutedDim      quietest text: helper lines, captions.
# accent        links, focus ring, primary button, switch when on.
# accentHover   accent on hover.
# danger        destructive text and button.
# dangerHover   danger on hover.

bg=#212529
surface=#2c3136
surfaceHover=#363c42
line=#3a4047
text=#e9ecef
muted=#adb5bd
mutedDim=#91989f
accent=#00a6ff
accentHover=#33b8ff
danger=#ff7b72
dangerHover=#ff8f87
